  "selection_limit": "Purposive four-original-method comparison; no systematic literature saturation or new empirical data.",
  "safety_gates": [
    "Do not close strict replacement bound (ties preserve).",
    "Do not treat an upper bound on unobserved reward as measured merely because it appears in a model.",
    "Do not claim unbounded nuisance reward gives strictly positive rights-value.",
    "Do not infer monetary-equivalent utility without justified cost/utility normalization.",
    "Do not apply deterministic bounds to noisy, selected or noncompliant choices.",
    "Do not silently change a fixed latent reward into state-varying nuisance to rescue conflicting observations.",
    "Do not erase original B identity, effective refusal or independently autonomous future.",
    "Do not treat set identification region as 95% confidence interval.",
    "Do not conflate model compatibility with real AI/internal motive evidence.",
    "Do not promote PI-RAMP version as independent verification of RVD or new theorem."
  ],
